  "description": "Gangster leader Cha Jun-hyeok is asked by his former boss and benefactor to protect his son Won-ha Lee until he becomes an adult.\n\nJun-hyeok faithfully fulfills the benefactor's request.  \nAs he watches from afar as he grows into a beautiful child, he becomes aware of the strange feelings that are blooming in his heart, but he tries to ignore everything.\n\nIn the end, Jun-hyeok decides to leave for Won-ha's normal life as an adult.\n\nBut there were already too many people looking for Wonha...",
